<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Hatton H1 net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Hatton H1 net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months to June:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				    H1 1996	   H1 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		    2,210.45   vs   1,588.72</p>
<p>    Net profit		    226.55   vs     227.57</p>
<p>    Tax				48.00   vs	47.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Hatton National Bank Ltd is a leading bank and the second largest company listed on the Colombo bourse in terms of market capitalisation.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
